  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「さっきからこの辺りをうろついているようだけど、旧校舎に何か用なの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「危険だからあまり近寄らない方がいいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「幽霊は出ないけど、床が腐りかけてたりするから、要注意なの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ふぅん。たまにはお昼を一人で食べたい、ね……贅沢な悩みなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしはこないだの幽霊騒ぎまで、お昼ご飯はたいていひとりで食べてたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あんまり友達が多いことをアピールされると、拗ねたくなるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「……わたしはどうしてここにいるのか、って？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「例のごとく、いかりんぐから逃げてきたところなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「いかりんぐ……水泳部の後輩なんだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしを見るとなぜか噛みついてくるの。理不尽なの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「いかりんぐ本人としては、甘噛みのつもりなんだろうけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「いかりんぐはもともと歯の力が強いのか、甘噛みのつもりなのにけっこう痛いの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「だから、いかりんぐの来ない旧校舎に逃げ込むつもりだったの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
